### Placing Summaries at the Top

By default, summary rows appear at the bottom of each group. You can place them at the top instead
by setting `side="top"`.

::: {#c99836a3 .cell execution_count=4}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(
    gt_sales
    .summary_rows(
        fns={"Total": pl.col("units_sold", "revenue").sum()},
        side="top"
    )
)
```

